  "definitions": {
    "AccessConfigurationPort": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "访问方式配置端口、协议、证书等信息。",
      "properties": {
        "operator": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "配置模式。\n- 如果operator值为空,则表示使用全量覆盖模式进行配置,否则表示使用增删改模式进行配置。且此级列表的所有元素的operator值必须同时全为空或者非空。\n- 当使用增删改模式时,operator取值支持\"add\",\"copy\",\"modify\",\"delete\",分别表示新增,复制指定uid的元素修改后新增,修改指定uid的元素,删除指定uid的元素。\n- 当operator取值为\"copy\",\"modify\",\"delete\"时,uid的值必须为非空,且存在于最后一次生效的配置中。\n- 当operator取值为\"copy\",\"modify\"时,与operator同级别的字段中除uid外的所有字段如不写,置空或者为空列表,则表示保留在最后一次生效配置中指定uid的元素的同一字段的值。\n"
        },
        "uid": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "端口配置的uid。"
        },
        "target_port": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "监听端口。"
        },
        "port": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "访问端口。"
        },
        "protocol": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "协议,负载均衡支持TCP,负载均衡与路由配置支持HTTP、HTTPS。",
          "enum": [
            "TCP",
            "HTTP",
            "HTTPS"
          ]
        },
        "default_certificate": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "默认证书,访问方式配置为转发策略且协议为HTTPS时配置,未配置域名证书对时使用默认证书。"
        },
        "certificate": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "证书。"
        },
        "policy": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "安全策略。",
          "enum": [
            "tls-1-2-strict",
            "tls-1-2",
            "tls-1-1",
            "tls-1-0"
          ]
        },
        "paths": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/AccessConfigurationHttpPath"
          }
        },
        "elb_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "用户选择的elb的ID。"
        }
      }
    },
    "VolumeConfigurationMountInfo": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "云存储配置挂载信息。",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "容器挂载路径。"
        },
        "sub_path": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "子路径。"
        },
        "access_mode": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "读写权限。",
          "enum": [
            "ReadWriteMany",
            "ReadOnlyMany"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "HealthCheckConfigurationLivenessProbe": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "组件健康检查配置的存活探针配置。",
      "properties": {
        "periodSeconds": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "检测周期,单位为s。"
        },
        "initialDelaySeconds": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "延迟时间,单位为s。"
        },
        "timeoutSeconds": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "超时时间,单位为s。"
        },
        "successThreshold": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "成功阈值。"
        },
        "failureThreshold": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "最大失败次数。"
        },
        "httpGet": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/HealthCheckConfigurationHttpGet"
        },
        "tcpSocket": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/HealthCheckConfigurationTcpSocket"
        },
        "exec": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/HealthCheckConfigurationExec"
        }
      }
    },
    "Parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "构建附加参数。\n- base_image:基础镜像地址。\n- build_cmd:自定义构建命令。\n- dockerfile_path:自定义dockerfile文件路径\n- dockerfile_content:自定义dockerfile内容\n- artifact_name: 针对java多模块构建,指定构建后运行的产物,以\".jar\"结尾。",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "example": {
        "base_image": "openjdk:8u181-jdk-alpine",
        "build_cmd": "mvn clean package"
      }
    },
    "EnvConfigurationDataAnnotations": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "环境变量配置。\n常用环境变量如下:\n- TZ: 时区设置,东八区可设置为Asia/Shanghai。\n- LANG: 语言字符集设置,中文UTF8可设置为zh_CN.UTF-8。",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "AccessConfigurationDataItems": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "访问方式配置项。",
      "properties": {
        "operator": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "配置模式。\n- 如果operator值为空,则表示使用全量覆盖模式进行配置,否则表示使用增删改模式进行配置。且此级列表的所有元素的operator值必须同时全为空或者非空。\n- 当使用增删改模式时,operator取值支持\"add\",\"copy\",\"modify\",\"delete\",分别表示新增,复制指定uid的元素修改后新增,修改指定uid的元素,删除指定uid的元素。\n- 当operator取值为\"copy\",\"modify\",\"delete\"时,uid的值必须为非空,且存在于最后一次生效的配置中。\n- 当operator取值为\"copy\",\"modify\"时,与operator同级别的字段中除uid外的所有字段如不写,置空或者为空列表,则表示保留在最后一次生效配置中指定uid的元素的同一字段的值。\n"
        },
        "uid": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "访问方式的uid。"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/AccessConfigurationMetadata"
        },
        "type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "访问方式类型。",
          "enum": [
            "ClusterIP",
            "LoadBalancer",
            "Ingress"
          ]
        },
        "domain_names": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "内网访问方式域名。",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "access_control": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/AccessControl"
        },
        "ports": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "访问方式配置端口、协议、证书、URL路径等信息列表。",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/AccessConfigurationPort"
          }
        },
        "elb_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "用户选择的elb的ID。"
        },
        "public_ip": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "响应体参数,用户选择的elb的公网ip。"
        },
        "private_ip": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "响应体参数,用户选择的elb的私网ip。"
        }
      }
    },
    "HealthCheckConfigurationHttpGet": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "健康检查配置中HTTP请求检查信息。",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "URL路径。"
        },
        "port": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "端口。"
        },
        "scheme": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "协议。",
          "enum": [
            "HTTP",
            "HTTPS"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "构建产物纳管。",
      "properties": {
        "artifact_namespace": {
          "description": "产物纳管SWR组织。",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "VolumeConfigurationDataVolume": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "云存储配置数据。",
      "properties": {
        "volume_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "云存储ID。",
          "x-sec-authority-parameter": "Y"
        },
        "resource_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "云存储名称。"
        },
        "resource_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "云存储类型。",
          "enum": [
            "obs",
            "sfs"
          ]
        },
        "resource_sub_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "云存储子类型。",
          "enum": [
            "object_bucket",
            "parallel_file_system",
            "sfs3.0"
          ]
        },
        "umask": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "设置目录或文件缺省权限,默认值0027,sfs3.0类型的云存储不支持配置此参数。"
        },
        "mount_info": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/VolumeConfigurationMountInfo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LifeCycleConfigurationExec": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "执行命令。",
      "properties": {
        "command": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "shell语句。",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AccessConfigurationMetadata": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "访问方式配置元数据。",
      "properties": {
        "annotations": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "附加参数。\n\n举例:负载均衡分配策略使用加权轮询算法,不启用健康检查。配置如下:\n- \"kubernetes.io/elb.health-check-flag\": \"off\"\n- \"kubernetes.io/elb.lb-algorithm\": \"ROUND_ROBIN\"\n",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AccessConfigurationHttpPath": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "匹配路径和域名信息。",
      "properties": {
        "hostname": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "域名/不填,不填时表示使用IP。"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "URL路径。"
        },
        "url_match_mode": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "URL路径匹配模式,支持前缀匹配、正则匹配、精准匹配。",
          "enum": [
            "STARTS_WITH",
            "REGEX",
            "EQUAL_TO"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "CreateComponentSpec": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "组件规格。",
      "properties": {
        "runtime": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "语言/运行时。",
          "enum": [
            "Docker",
            "Java8",
            "Java11",
            "Java17",
            "Java21",
            "Tomcat8",
            "Tomcat9",
            "Python3",
            "Nodejs8",
            "Nodejs14",
            "Nodejs16",
            "Php7",
            "Php8",
            "Dotnet6",
            "Dotnet7",
            "Dotnet8"
          ]
        },
        "env_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "环境ID。"
        },
        "replica": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "description": "实例个数。"
        },
        "source": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Source"
        },
        "build": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Build"
        },
        "resource_limit": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ResourceLimit"
        },
